      en: ["The church was completed in the year 1853.", "Architect Ernst Bernhard Lohrmann designed the building in the Empire style.", "The church has a seating capacity of approximately 1,200 people.", "The altarpiece was painted by Pekka Halonen in 1881.", "The organ was built by the Kangasala Organ Factory in 1904.", "This structure is the fourth church built in Karstula's history."],
